  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.1": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] Hello, and welcome to the Sapphire Advanced Research Corporation. I\u2019m Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang.",
  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.2": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] If you\u2019ve just arrived, take a moment to get your bearings. Reception is your first stop\u2014they\u2019ll help you check in and find where you\u2019re supposed to be.",
  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.3": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] Please have your identification ready, and keep the main walkway clear. Some of us are still trying to get to work.",
  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.4": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] A quick reminder: an open security door is not an invitation. If your clearance doesn\u2019t cover what\u2019s on the other side, please leave it alone.",
  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.5": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] If you feel unwell, or something doesn\u2019t seem right, speak to the medical team. You\u2019re not bothering them. That\u2019s what they\u2019re here for.",
  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.6": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] And\u2026 look after each other, alright? It\u2019s easy to get caught up in the work down here.",
  "message.timelocked.arrival_welcome.7": "[PA \u00b7 Dr. Everleigh Alexi Darkfang \u00b7 Pre-recorded] Right. That\u2019s enough from me. Welcome to SARC. I\u2019m glad you\u2019re here.",
